/E (      The main objective of our team is learning, so we believe it is important that students do as much of the work as possible. All key design decisions and build processes are student-led, while mentors provide advice if needed. The main objective of our team is learning, so we believe it is important that students do as much of the work as possible. Our team hopes to learn and educate through hands-on experience in engineering. This process-oriented approach heavily influences our design decisions; we are more likely to select a unique and interesting mechanism as we prioritize the valuable learning lessons that come with taking these risks.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
