/E (     With international roots, we place a strong emphasis on global outreach. Therefore, we took up the opportunity to mentor an FLL Team at High Gate International Academy in Kigali, Rwanda. Each week, we meet with the team to answer any questions they may have, provide guidance on their innovation project, and help them find the same spark we found as young FLL Roboticists. We also aided in the creation of a second team in Austin, Texas. These teams were initially just groups of students interested in robotics, but we helped them solidify and explore their interests by transitioning them into FIRST.- 49 Hours)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [3]
>>
