<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 170 0 R
/E (     Intaking the artifacts involves sets of intake wheels which roll the artifacts into the robot.  Once within the robots frame, they are pushed by a paddle into the shooter.  We chose this design to minimize the time spent transferring the ball from the field to the shooter. In the same vein, we chose not to implement an indexing system because we believe the strategic tradeoff from MOTIFS is simply not worth it; decreasing cycle time in TeleOp was our priority. )
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
